e is no  100  free market and there is no 100  oppressive market so  the ripple effect is an interesting  question because  just like autocracies have a ripple  effect and we've seen that in recent in  the recent past  so does freedom and we've seen that in  the recent past we see with the  president of ukraine and  even though he was a smaller force than  the russian military  that  his stand for freedom  changed the whole world's perspective on  it and i i'm feeling that as the manager  of this fund so  i hope the ripple effect in the end will  be that investors will direct their  assets towards freer countries countries  that are promoting peace and freedom in  the world versus countries that are  promoting other things like  oppression and slavery so i hope that is  the end game of the ripple effect and in  the meantime i hope that more people  will consider this type of strategy as  one that one aligns with their values  and two generates outperformance in the  long run  you
 

